<title>SWEDEN: Mobile phone sales in Sweden slip in Jan-industry.</title>
<headline>Mobile phone sales in Sweden slip in Jan-industry.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobile telephone sales in Sweden fell to 38,900 in January which was a 25 percent drop from the 51,700 sold January 1996, the industry group Mobile Telephone Deliveries (MTL) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>MTL said in a statement that 36,700 GSM phones and 2,200 NMT phones were sold last month.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1018</p>
</text>
